2-6B11C6.jpg"]]}},"Mini/Clubman/Clubman":{"s":[["",[["N60","adapt","Zaradi zelo ozke odprtine je to edini način, da izkoristite širino med kolesnima lokoma z največjo kletko: podrite zadnje sedeže, kletko dvignite v vozilo (4. fotografija) in jo obrnite na podrte sedeže (5. fotografija) – spodnji rob naj leži v pregibu med sedeži in dnom. Kletko postavite pokonci (6. in 7. fotografija) in jo povlecite naprej (8. fotografija). Nato sedeže dvignite in zaskočite."],["N65 N67","ok",""]]]],"w":["Ustrezajo le N60, N65 in N67."],"p":{"N60":[["Mini_Clubman/IMG_7EA0AA-7FA429-0D9FAB-62631A-216B35-B198AD.jpg"],["Mini_Clubman/IMG_157F65-4BE5A7-9A5DB7-2EB025-237C12-5BEDD4.jpg"],["Mini_Clubman/IMG_9527FC-7DFD1C-498D0C-8C9F99-37F498-AA29CD.jpg"]]}},"Mini/Aceman/Aceman":{"s":[["",[["N65 N67","adapt","Originalno ploščo dna odstranite in izdelajte novo, enako originalni, le brez obeh zatičev zadaj levo in desno. Kletko vstavite z dnom naprej, nato novo ploščo iz notranjosti potisnite pod kletko."],["N60","no","Ne ustreza – preširoka."]]]],"w":["Zelo tesno – ustrezata le N65 in N67, pa še to le z obvodom. V N65 in N67 ne gre nemški ovčar, labradorec ali zlati prinašalec."],"p":{"N60":[["Mini_Aceman/IMG_9FF86D-9B51EA-B66492-A0CB79-30F791-EF14E3.jpg","N60 ne ustreza – preširoka."]],"N65":[["Mini_Aceman/IMG_10EEAB-B3193E-34D17E-1EEC00-48E011-6D8FA4.jpg"],["Mini_Aceman/IMG_B1231F-D92CF5-1A9368-0DAB05-F5FC26-7046CB.jpg"],["Mini_Aceman/IMG_2BC5DF-390DBA-F840AE-A2AF0D-8F219A-F6812C.jpg"]],"N67":[["Mini_Aceman/IMG_37A36C-988BD1-DD1C55-CF8708-460E2B-089102.jpg"],["Mini_Aceman/IMG_90D0EE-383732-E1F885-770384-0D96EF-B174D6.jpg"],["Mini_Aceman/IMG_A12D81-D826BB-2F0981-3B39FD-972244-864363.jpg"]]},"x":[["Mini_Aceman/IMG_7CEB06-6A6B8A-F6F66A-D637E7-7DD011-3A4FE4.jpg","Prazen prtljažnik brez dna"],["Mini_Aceman/IMG_4D65FD-F71F95-FAD3DF-36055A-89D65F-9C483D.jpg","Dno prtljažnika"],["Mini_Aceman/IMG_8A3ACC-D38B35-527728-47CB92-F8F135-856219.jpg","Izdelana nadomestna plošča dna"],["Mini_Aceman/IMG_CC2F